Goal:

Continuously collect alerts/metrics from Prometheus, Grafana, and New Relic → stream them to GCP → let an AI Agent (Gemini) interpret and summarize alerts in natural language.

Components 


| Layer                    | Tool/Service                           | Purpose                                                      |
| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Monitoring & Metrics** | Prometheus                             | Scrape metrics from VMs, containers, and apps                |
|                          | Grafana                                | Visualization and alerting rules                             |
|                          | New Relic                              | Cloud-level performance monitoring and external integrations |
| **Data Pipeline**        | Cloud Pub/Sub                          | Capture alert notifications as events                        |
|                          | Cloud Functions (Python)               | Receive alerts → push to BigQuery or directly to AI Agent    |
| **AI Analysis Layer**    | Vertex AI Agent / Gemini 1.5 Flash     | Parse, summarize, and classify alerts                        |
| **UI / Output Layer**    | Streamlit or Gradio (or Grafana panel) | Display summarized AI insights & recommendations             |
